"""Publication-style qualitative detection panels, split into two figures.

Automatically mines the UMMC external test set for four representative scenarios,
then generates two figures comparing all ten HKL-trained architectures.

Outputs:
  qualitative_split_part1.png/.pdf  GT + first five models
  qualitative_split_part2.png/.pdf  GT + remaining five models
  qualitative_detection_counts.csv

Edit CONFIG before running. Predictions are evaluated on FULL tiles before
cropping; panel counts are re-evaluated within the visible crop.
"""
